WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.877
I am the only American,

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:03.837
probably the only person in the world,

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:06.465
who has been banned by a federal court

00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:08.842
from decorating for Christmas.

00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:12.137
I love Christmas more than life itself.

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:13.972
Christmas tree time, let's go!

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:15.265
He doesn't know when to stop.

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:16.975
Some people call me "Mr. Christmas."

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:18.143
Accurate.

00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:20.979
-This is the one.
-Honey, it's too big for the dining room.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.273
We gotta get a bigger house.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.986
Jeremy Morris said that he was

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.572
going to be purchasing a home
in our subdivision.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:34.117
Jeremy asked a ton of questions,
seemed kinda weird.

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:37.829
This house, it's perfect
for hosting this Christmas show.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.831
What is this guy up to?

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.959
This Christmas show,
five thousand people...

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.126
We need to make it bigger.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.545
Noise, the traffic...

00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:47.339
The people in this neighborhood
didn't want it. 

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:50.884
These neighbors threw a rock:

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:52.678
the threat of a lawsuit.

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.139
"Your planned event is not permitted."

00:00:56.223 --> 00:00:59.142
It's at that point that I decided
I'm going ahead with the show.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.562
What's going on here is not religious.

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:02.563
Penguins.

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:04.940
It was Frosty the Snowman
and hot chocolate...

00:01:05.649 --> 00:01:08.068
It was always his way or no way.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:11.280
At the end of the day,
is all this really worth it?

00:01:12.322 --> 00:01:13.156
Yes.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:17.035
Nobody is gonna stop me.

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:19.955
It's this constant loop of crazy.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.582
The thirty-five-person choir,
the camel...

00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:23.375
Intimidation, bully tactics...

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:27.462
If people think I'm crazy,
they don't know what I'm gonna do next.

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.381
You can always subpoena the camel.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:33.594
He is one hundred percent calculated.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.762
We'll be appealing to the Supreme Court.

00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:36.972
Now that's nuts.

00:01:37.431 --> 00:01:40.350
We have great neighbors,
pitted against one person.

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:43.812
My neighbors are essentially terrorists.

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:49.067
I wanted to become the guy
who saved Christmas.

00:01:49.985 --> 00:01:51.904
Oh, you didn't get a permit.

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:56.283
This is a miracle.
You don't get permits for miracles.

